    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Maze of Perdition</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ex-Brazilian special forces soldier. A VIP escort mission. A luxury cruise. And a disappearance in the Bermuda Triangle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being swallowed by an unknown force, Kael awakens on a cursed island, shaped like a colossal maze and ruled by demonic entities who manipulate humans in a bloody game. Fragments of ancient writings suggest these beings are remnants of a fallen celestial order, guardians of forbidden secrets. His only option: fight, survive, and unravel the mysteries linking the maze to forgotten legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Brutal Real-Time Combat</strong>: Face cruel and intelligent enemies in brutal arenas to acquire essential resources like food, ammunition, and equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Non-Linear Exploration</strong>: Navigate multiple routes, discover secret passages, and overcome environmental challenges in an interconnected world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Enigmatic Narrative</strong>: Inspired by mythology, occultism, and real-world mysteries, the story unfolds through ancient scrolls and forgotten symbols.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf11 <strong>Atmospheric Environments</strong>: Explore dark forests, claustrophobic caves, and distorted corridors, where spectral lights and unsettling sounds guide\u2014or deceive\u2014your steps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Unveil the Secrets</strong>: Throughout the journey, discover mystical keys that unlock secret portals and ancient scrolls that grant special abilities. Each discovery brings Kael closer to the truth behind the island and its hidden horrors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Survive the Unknown</strong>: Confront the island's villains in epic battles, survive deadly traps and mutant creatures, and uncover the truth about the beings that govern this place and their connection to ancient legends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the unknown. Unveil the mystery. Or be forgotten like so many others.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Maze of Perdition</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ex-Brazilian special forces soldier. A VIP escort mission. A luxury cruise. And a disappearance in the Bermuda Triangle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being swallowed by an unknown force, Kael awakens on a cursed island, shaped like a colossal maze and ruled by demonic entities who manipulate humans in a bloody game. Fragments of ancient writings suggest these beings are remnants of a fallen celestial order, guardians of forbidden secrets. His only option: fight, survive, and unravel the mysteries linking the maze to forgotten legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Brutal Real-Time Combat</strong>: Face cruel and intelligent enemies in brutal arenas to acquire essential resources like food, ammunition, and equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Non-Linear Exploration</strong>: Navigate multiple routes, discover secret passages, and overcome environmental challenges in an interconnected world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Enigmatic Narrative</strong>: Inspired by mythology, occultism, and real-world mysteries, the story unfolds through ancient scrolls and forgotten symbols.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf11 <strong>Atmospheric Environments</strong>: Explore dark forests, claustrophobic caves, and distorted corridors, where spectral lights and unsettling sounds guide\u2014or deceive\u2014your steps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Unveil the Secrets</strong>: Throughout the journey, discover mystical keys that unlock secret portals and ancient scrolls that grant special abilities. Each discovery brings Kael closer to the truth behind the island and its hidden horrors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Survive the Unknown</strong>: Confront the island's villains in epic battles, survive deadly traps and mutant creatures, and uncover the truth about the beings that govern this place and their connection to ancient legends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the unknown. Unveil the mystery. Or be forgotten like so many others.</p>",
    "short_description": "Survive in a cursed island filled with dangers and mysteries. Face various shadowy creatures, fight in brutal arenas, and collect mystical keys to escape. Use strategy, exploration, and intense combat to defeat ancient beings and uncover the secrets of a relentless hunting game.",
